# `!tiles/**` re-includes EVERYTHING under tiles/, which undoes the global ignore too — a stray .DS_Store
# in an art directory showed up as something to commit. Re-exclude it here rather than in the repo root:
# the negation is what caused it, so the correction belongs beside it.
tiles/**/.DS_Store
tiles/preview.png
